            <history xml:id="history_id9ebea5eb">
               <p xml:id="idm89">Hans Christian Andersen's introductory text "Gjallerhornet lød og henover Regnbuerne rede Guderne, klædte i Staal, for at kæmpe den sidste Kamp; ___ den hele Luft lyste om dem med Nordlys = Blink, men Mørket var det seirende", is a citation from the fairytale "Dynd-Kongens Datter" (The Marsh King's Daughter), which had been published six years earlier.</p>
